  characterName: Studying Sam
  description: Studying Sam sits in one of the chairs, doing, well, some more studying
    it seems.
  characterType: 1
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  hasBeenMet: 1
  ambientLines:
  - speakerName: 
    text: 'Hey, do you have any-

      Studying Sam: Look, I never have any time
      for anything besides studying, you know this already. Please leave me be.'
  - speakerName: 
    text: 'Why is your name also Sam?

      Studying Sam: It''s a common name, brainiac.
      And no, before you ask, I''m not related to any other Sams on campus. I''m
      just here to study.'
  - speakerName: 
    text: 'Hey, do you know anything about-

      Studying Sam: You''re gonna ask
      me about something not related to me studying. You don''t need to finish that
      sentence, because I can''t tell you.'
  - speakerName: 
    text: 'You wouldn''t know anything about any flyers, would you?

      Studying
      Sam: I really have no idea what you''re talking about, all I do is study.

      :
      Yeah I have no idea either. Just something that crossed my mind, it''s all
      fine, I think it was-

      Studying Sam: Please just leave me alone.'
